{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "ordinance_quirks",
  "spec": ["ordinance 3.6", "ordinance 4.2", "ordinance 4.3", "ordinance 4.4", "ordinance 11", "ordinance 13.6"],
  "description": "SetOrdinanceOn(id, true) on an unavailable ordinance charges the enactment every call and reports data3 = 0; when it becomes available it is re-enacted and charged again. AddOrdinance of an available+on ordinance (standard or foreign) enacts it twice; RemoveOrdinance repeals and withdraws it and drops the map's reference; adding a second object with the same ID replaces the first. LegalizeGambling's SetOn(false) demolishes every lot of building type 0x033A0000 in one call, hides that conditional building and removes the input control 0x88F154FB when current; it runs on every SetOn(false), including the off-then-on re-announcement.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "ordinance_env", "lots": [{"lot": 1, "building_type": "0x033A0000"}, {"lot": 2, "building_type": "0x00000001"}, {"lot": 3, "building_type": "0x033A0000"}],
      "view_control": "0x88F154FB"},
    {"op": "ordinance_exemplar", "instance": "0x00D0723D", "enact": -10, "repeal": -10, "constant": -50, "factor": 0},
